Bundled / third-party software

This add-on's container image builds and bundles Asterisk, which is licensed
under the GNU General Public License version 2 (GPLv2), © Sangoma Technologies.
Asterisk runs as a separate process; HA-Phone interacts with it only via its
AMI interface and generated configuration files (mere aggregation, not a
derivative work). Asterisk source is obtained from the official distribution:
https://downloads.asterisk.org/pub/telephony/asterisk/ -- Asterisk's own
COPYING/LICENSE files ship unmodified inside this image alongside the compiled
binary. Asterisk itself remains under its own GPLv2 terms regardless of this
add-on's own license.

Other bundled components retain their respective licenses (e.g. FastAPI — MIT,
React — MIT). The All Rights Reserved terms above apply only to the HA-Phone
project's own code (backend, frontend, add-on configuration, and templates) —
not to any bundled third-party component listed here.
